                <div class="corporate-actions">
                    <a class="corporate-button corporate-button-primary" href="#programs">Explore our programs <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                    <a class="corporate-button corporate-button-secondary" href="mailto:ittechgenie1@gmail.com">Plan a cohort</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <aside class="corporate-promise" aria-label="Our training promise">
                <span>Our training promise</span>
                <ol>
                    <li><b>01</b> Architecture-backed subject expertise</li>
                    <li><b>02</b> Hands-on labs and working use cases</li>
                    <li><b>03</b> Role-aligned learning journeys</li>
                    <li><b>04</b> Assessment, mentoring and reporting</li>
                </ol>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="corporate-shell corporate-stats" aria-label="Training experience">
        <div><strong>18+ years</strong><span>Technology and architecture experience</span></div>
        <div><strong>200+ batches</strong><span>Learning programs delivered</span></div>
        <div><strong>40+ engagements</strong><span>Corporate training programs</span></div>
