    <section class="corporate-section">
        <div class="corporate-shell">
            <div class="corporate-heading">
                <span>Who we are</span>
                <h2>Corporate learning shaped by real engineering work.</h2>
                <p>We build job-ready capability through conceptual clarity, guided practice, architecture thinking and project-based application.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="corporate-about-grid">
                <article class="corporate-panel corporate-about-copy">
                    <div class="corporate-icon"><i class="fas fa-building"></i></div>
                    <h3>Training that respects the workplace</h3>
                    <p>Production experience across AI systems, RAG and agent orchestration, cloud data platforms, application modernization, governance, quality engineering, IoT and embedded systems is translated into structured learning paths for technical teams and leaders.</p>
                </article>
                <div class="corporate-values">
                    <article><b>01</b><div><h3>Practice before theory fades</h3><p>Every module is reinforced with demonstrations, labs or design exercises.</p></div></article>
                    <article><b>02</b><div><h3>Enterprise context</h3><p>Security, governance, cost, testing and operations are built into learning.</p></div></article>
                    <article><b>03</b><div><h3>Evidence of learning</h3><p>Assessments, capstones and reporting make progress visible.</p></div></article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="corporate-trust">
        <div class="corporate-shell">
            <p>Prior training and mentoring experience represented in our leadership profiles</p>
            <div><span>IBM</span><span>Fidelity</span><span>Capgemini</span><span>Dell</span><span>Mindtree</span><span>Cognizant</span><span>LPU / Punjab University</span></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="corporate-section corporate-soft" id="programs">
        <div class="corporate-shell">
            <div class="corporate-heading corporate-heading-center">
                <span>Training portfolio</span>
                <h2>Deep technical programs for modern enterprise teams.</h2>
                <p>Choose a standard curriculum or customize the journey around your stack, roles, use cases and target proficiency.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="corporate-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter training programs">
                <button class="active" type="button" data-training-filter="all">All programs</button>
                <button type="button" data-training-filter="ai">AI &amp; Agents</button>
                <button type="button" data-training-filter="data">Data &amp; Governance</button>
                <button type="button" data-training-filter="app">Application &amp; DevOps</button>
                <button type="button" data-training-filter="iot">IoT &amp; Embedded</button>
            </div>
            <div class="corporate-program-grid">
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="ai"><span>AI 01</span><i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i><h3>Generative AI &amp; Prompt Engineering</h3><p>LLM foundations, structured prompting, model behavior, responsible usage and enterprise automation.</p><div><small>LLMs</small><small>Azure OpenAI</small><small>Responsible AI</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="ai"><span>AI 02</span><i class="fas fa-magnifying-glass-chart"></i><h3>RAG &amp; Knowledge Applications</h3><p>Ingestion, embeddings, hybrid retrieval, reranking, grounding, evaluation and secure knowledge access.</p><div><small>RAG</small><small>GraphRAG</small><small>Neo4j</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="ai"><span>AI 03</span><i class="fas fa-robot"></i><h3>Agentic AI, LangGraph &amp; MCP</h3><p>Tool-using agents, routing, memory, multi-agent patterns, human review and failure recovery.</p><div><small>LangGraph</small><small>MCP</small><small>AutoGen</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="ai"><span>AI 04</span><i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i><h3>Production AI, Guardrails &amp; LLMOps</h3><p>Policy gates, golden datasets, evaluation, observability, cost control and release gates.</p><div><small>Evals</small><small>Guardrails</small><small>AI FinOps</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="data"><span>DATA 01</span><i class="fas fa-database"></i><h3>Azure Data Engineering &amp; Databricks</h3><p>ADF, Spark, PySpark, Delta Lake, medallion architecture, optimization and secure delivery.</p><div><small>Databricks</small><small>PySpark</small><small>Delta Lake</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="data"><span>GOV 01</span><i class="fas fa-diagram-project"></i><h3>Microsoft Purview Governance</h3><p>Unified Catalog, glossary, scanning, classification, lineage, stewardship and health controls.</p><div><small>Purview</small><small>Lineage</small><small>Stewardship</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="app"><span>APP 01</span><i class="fas fa-code"></i><h3>.NET Full-Stack Development</h3><p>C#, ASP.NET Core, Web API, EF Core, React or Angular, secure integration and implementation.</p><div><small>.NET</small><small>React</small><small>Angular</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="app"><span>DEV 01</span><i class="fas fa-infinity"></i><h3>DevOps, Testing &amp; Observability</h3><p>CI/CD, Git, testing, infrastructure as code, tracing and production release practices.</p><div><small>Docker</small><small>Terraform</small><small>OpenTelemetry</small></div></article>
                <article class="corporate-program" data-training-category="iot"><span>IOT 01</span><i class="fas fa-microchip"></i><h3>IoT, Embedded &amp; Connected Systems</h3><p>Embedded C/C++, Linux, MQTT, Azure IoT, telemetry and real-time connected solutions.</p><div><small>C/C++</small><small>Azure IoT</small><small>MQTT</small></div></article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="corporate-section" id="delivery">
        <div class="corporate-shell">
            <div class="corporate-heading"><span>Delivery model</span><h2>Designed around roles, readiness and business outcomes.</h2></div>
            <div class="corporate-delivery">
                <article class="corporate-formats">
                    <span class="corporate-kicker">Flexible formats</span><h3>One format—or a blended academy.</h3>
                    <div><span>Instructor-led classroom</span><span>Virtual instructor-led</span><span>Bootcamp programs</span><span>Role-based academies</span><span>Architecture workshops</span><span>Train-the-trainer</span><span>Capstone mentoring</span><span>Project evaluation</span></div>
                </article>
                <div class="corporate-steps">
                    <article><b>01</b><div><span>Discover</span><h3>Training needs analysis</h3><p>Map roles, proficiency, tools and expected job outcomes.</p></div></article>
                    <article><b>02</b><div><span>Design</span><h3>Curriculum customization</h3><p>Build the journey, labs, assessments and environment plan.</p></div></article>
                    <article><b>03</b><div><span>Deliver</span><h3>Concept + demonstration + lab</h3><p>Move from explanation to guided implementation and review.</p></div></article>
                    <article><b>04</b><div><span>Measure</span><h3>Assessment and reporting</h3><p>Track assignments, quizzes, capstones and performance.</p></div></article>
                    <article><b>05</b><div><span>Mentor</span><h3>Reinforcement and support</h3><p>Provide project reviews, remediation and applied mentoring.</p></div></article>
                    <article><b>06</b><div><span>Hand off</span><h3>Reusable learning assets</h3><p>Share code, lab guides, notes and completion evidence.</p></div></article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="corporate-section corporate-outcomes">
        <div class="corporate-shell">
            <div class="corporate-heading corporate-heading-center"><span>Learning outcomes</span><h2>More than course completion.</h2><p>Practical capability that transfers into delivery teams.</p></div>
            <div class="corporate-outcome-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Applied proficiency</h3><p>Build, troubleshoot and explain working solutions.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Architecture awareness</h3><p>Understand design choices, boundaries and trade-offs.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Enterprise readiness</h3><p>Address security, governance, operations and cost.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Visible progress</h3><p>Give stakeholders evidence through assessments and reports.</p></article></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="corporate-section corporate-soft">
        <div class="corporate-shell">
            <div class="corporate-heading"><span>Training leadership</span><h2>Senior practitioners who teach from experience.</h2></div>
            <div class="corporate-faculty">
                <article><div class="corporate-avatar">GS</div><div><h3>Gopinath Subbaian</h3><span>Corporate Training &amp; Solution Architecture</span><p>18+ years across enterprise development, training, cloud, data engineering, governance and AI-enabled applications.</p><ul><li>200+ batches and 40+ corporate training engagements</li><li>GenAI, RAG, Purview, Azure, Databricks, .NET and DevOps</li><li>Labs, mentoring, assessments, capstones and reporting</li></ul></div></article>
                <article><div class="corporate-avatar">LP</div><div><h3>Lokesh Prasanna Kumar S</h3><span>AI Architecture &amp; Advanced Engineering</span><p>18+ years spanning production AI platforms, cloud data systems and connected technologies.</p><ul><li>Post Graduate in Generative AI and Agentic AI from IIT Roorkee</li><li>Agentic systems, GraphRAG, MCP, guardrails and evaluation</li><li>Voice AI, AI FinOps, LLMOps, Azure data, IoT and embedded systems</li></ul></div></article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="corporate-section corporate-engage">
        <div class="corporate-shell">
            <div class="corporate-heading"><span>Engagement options</span><h2>Start with the format that fits your goal.</h2></div>
            <div class="corporate-engage-grid"><article><i class="fas fa-compass"></i><span>Foundation</span><h3>Focused Workshop</h3><p>One- to three-day concept and demonstration program for awareness or leadership enablement.</p></article><article><i class="fas fa-laptop-code"></i><span>Capability</span><h3>Hands-on Bootcamp</h3><p>Applied learning with labs, exercises, assessments and a practical mini-project.</p></article><article><i class="fas fa-people-group"></i><span>Transformation</span><h3>Enterprise Academy</h3><p>Role-based paths, capstones, mentoring, reporting and knowledge transfer across cohorts.</p></article></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="corporate-cta">
        <div class="corporate-shell"><span>Let's build capability together</span><h2>Design an enterprise learning program around your actual technology goals.</h2><p>Tell us about your team, stack and desired outcomes. We’ll help shape the right workshop, bootcamp or academy.</p><a class="corporate-button corporate-button-primary" href="mailto:ittechgenie1@gmail.com"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Start a conversation</a></div>
    </section>
</div>

<script>
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-training-filter]').forEach(button => {
        button.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const filter = button.dataset.trainingFilter;
            document.querySelectorAll('[data-training-filter]').forEach(item => item.classList.remove('active'));
            button.classList.add('active');
            document.querySelectorAll('[data-training-category]').forEach(card => {
                card.hidden = filter !== 'all' && card.dataset.trainingCategory !== filter;
            });
        });
    });
</script>

